      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RILEY DOZER (8) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (30.23) in a Grade 5 at this track. Can make amends. STAND UP TONY (2) has a strong overall record having five wins and four places from 11 starts including a last start second (22.36) over 400m at Bulli. Solid record at this trip including two wins. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. GALBA MAJOR (6) turned in a plain effort last time when eighth at this track over 520m behind Entertainer (30.74) in a Grade 5. Deserves plenty of respect. WINSOME STORM (3) has strong claims after a top-three finish in good time last time out.",
